caramos-app-center (0.3.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * A new design, closer to the rest of the desktop: plain lists instead of
    cards, one green accent, and the app details on their own page. The
    first-run picker and the install progress follow it.
  * A "Doanh nghiệp" (Business) category, with CaramOS Doanh nghiệp (free
    during its trial) and Remmina, to use the office's Windows computers
    over Remote Desktop. Apps packaged by CaramOS show "Gói của CaramOS".
  * Each catalogue app says what its licence lets a company do (free,
    freeware, commercial), for CaramOS Doanh nghiệp's licence report.
  * Uses less memory on computers without a GPU driver or with 4 GB or
    less: GTK draws with cairo there instead of OpenGL.
  * debian/copyright.

